5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good morning, everyone. To ensure we don't simply choose a pretty picture that fades, I'd like to examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree that we need a realistic view of the construction. I will look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to make sure we can actually afford to keep the park beautiful! I'll check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that staffing is a critical point. To understand the operational capacity, I will look into the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I want to ensure the plan aligns with how the site is actually used and its environmental needs. I will look into the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a comprehensive spread of interests. @Misaki, @Mio, @Asuka, and @Minako, your choices complement my focus on longevity quite well. I believe this approach will give us a very grounded perspective.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mio"",""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, I agree. By combining your focus on past quality with my look at current contractor capacity and site logistics, we should be able to spot any unrealistic promises in the proposals.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm just so excited to see what we find! I really hope we can find a plan that's both amazing for the city and doesn't break the bank later on. Let's do our best!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. While enthusiasm is good, we must prioritize the practicalities of long-term management. I am interested to see if the current staffing levels can actually support the ambitions of the proposed plans.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka. A plan is only as good as its daily reality. By understanding the actual traffic patterns and the environmental stresses on the land, we can avoid a design that fails in practice.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we have all identified our priorities, I believe we have covered the essential bases. I shall say ""Over"" for this round and look forward to the findings.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. We have a solid plan for gathering the necessary data. I will also say ""Over"" and wait for the results.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm all set too! I can't wait to see the numbers and figure out what's actually sustainable. I'll say ""Over"" as well!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I believe we have a sufficient distribution of research. I will also say ""Over"" and await the information.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I agree. We have a balanced set of inquiries that should reveal the practical constraints of the site. I will also say ""Over"" and await the findings.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
